# Cloudflare — new account: set CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID, D1_DATABASE_ID, wrangler database_id on both Workers. Deploy order: primary, license, Pages. API hosts this project uses: https://rootrecord-primary.rootrecord.workers.dev (Pages ROOTRECORD_API_BASE / WEATHER_API_PUBLIC_URL) and https://rootrecord-license.rootrecord.workers.dev (desktop LICENSE_API_BASE_URL).
